WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,500
I hate Lin Zicheng

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:04,020
As soon as I heard it was his party, I didn’t want to go.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,100
Do you still remember what Miss Pei said when you first met Mr. Lin?

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,980
He and Lin Zicheng came together because his parents had to set him up, and he didn't like him either.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,300
So what does it mean that he invites you this time?

6
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,980
Lin Zicheng ate my food last time

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,380
This time he wants to take me back to eat

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,410
This is obviously taking you there

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,130
Tell Lin Zicheng that his heart belongs to someone

10
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,290
Let him die

11
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,210
It also indirectly shows that he likes you

12
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,760
No, right? But that’s not what you’re talking about.

13
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:34,000
Are there three major misconceptions in life? If my phone vibrates, I can kill him. He likes my aunt.

14
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:35,800
Sir, shouldn’t he have grown up since he was a child?

15
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,200
I haven’t talked to girls a few times, right?

16
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:39,470
Small and sensible

17
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,030
Help us with the work after school

18
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,670
His dad runs a black car

19
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,550
When he was eight or nine years old, he was sitting next to him selling tickets.
